
Kickboxing instructions:

The main objective to this game is to become the best kickboxer around! To
become the champion of the ring! Once you beat all the computer fighters you
will become the top fighter. Then other players will fight you for the title.
There are several things you must do to earn you skills in this game.

Training:

You must train in order to raise you [Strength] in the game. If you are weak
you will not be able to beat other kickboxers. Training is one of the most
important features in the game! You will also earn power kicks that will do
2x the damage on any person. All trainers will not let you lose, what they
do is only increase your strength.

Matches:

Here is where you must fight to the top! There are 19 computer fighters, then
you are to be challenged by the champion! Once you beat the champ you will
become the champ and be ranked #20. Once you are ranked #20 then other players
must be rank #19 to fight you. Hold the title for until the game reset takes
effect and you will be the champion of the month.

